  9   4010              ; The BIOS's 256 shapes, names 0 to 255 from $1800: in Graphic I, 32 to a
 10   4010              ; line; then, from the same tables, in text mode, 40 to a line. The sprite
 11   4010              ; attribute table moves to $3F80, out of the way of text mode's 960 names.
